  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortal Fang Dong Xi of Fang clan is the nearest mobilizable immortal when Sand Heap blessed land appears. Soul cores he harvested in green ghost desert are stolen by Ling Hu Xu during the chaotic battle. Those soul cores are to be handed to Fang Yuan, and Fang clan’s cooperation with Fang Yuan cannot be exposed, so he cannot announce the loss and can only give chase. Shi Kang obstructs him with a killer move. Fang Dong Xi falsely charges that Shi clan is cooperating with a demonic bastard, then leads the righteous path encirclement when Shi Kang refuses to let them leave. He sneers that even if Shi Kang specializes in defensive killer moves and can turn into a rockman, Shi Kang cannot hold out, and he offers settlement by compensation so Fang clan will let bygones be bygones.",
      "chapters": [
        2130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_fang_clan",
        "loc_sand_heap_blessed_land",
        "res_soul_core",
        "char_ling_hu_xu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_shi_kang",
        "fac_shi_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Yi clan’s cloaked Gu Immortals intervene, he captures Wang Xiao Er while Shi Kang becomes the blessed land’s owner. He returns to Fang clan and reports the battle outcome, troubled that the remaining soul core quantity cannot meet the handover requirement.",
      "chapters": [
        2131
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sand-heap-outcome",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_yi_clan",
        "char_wang_xiao_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fallen Flower Hall is destroyed, and Fang Dong Xi and Fang An Lei, two elite rank sevens, die in the battle protecting Fang Di Chang.",
      "chapters": [
        2260
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-clan-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_fallen_flower_hall",
        "char_fang_an_lei",
        "char_fang_di_chang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Their immortal apertures fall to the ground and open to absorb heaven and earth qi, becoming unowned blessed lands that Xiao Ye Hu plunders. Before that death he had imprisoned Wang Xiao Er in an underground prison in his immortal aperture after soul searching him for Hu Land information.",
      "chapters": [
        2261
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-clan-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xiao_ye_hu",
        "loc_hu_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Human Sea revives Fang Dong Xi and Fang An Lei at rank seven cultivation. They stand confused on the beach, then learn of the situation from Fang Yuan’s will and are filled with joy that Lord Fang Yuan has such a method to revive them.",
      "chapters": [
        2267
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "human-sea-revival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_human_sea"
      ]
    }
  ],
